            "question": "What is your return policy?",
            "answer": "<p>We accept returns for items that arrive defective, damaged, or incorrect, as long as the issue is reported within 7 days of receiving the order. To help us assess the concern, please provide clear photos or videos showing the issue, including the packaging and condition upon opening. Items that show misuse, accidental damage, wear and tear, or issues caused after delivery are not eligible. Returned items must be in original condition with complete packaging.</p>",
